 readers from across the city.","example_zh":"都會圖書館服務來自全市的讀者。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/metropolitan-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-microbe-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"microbe","sort_order":1,"sense":"微生物","alt_zh":"高中生透過顯微鏡觀察，旁邊螢幕顯示放大的無字微生物影像。","example":"The model showed a microbe too small to see without magnification.","example_zh":"模型呈現肉眼難以看見的微生物。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/microbe-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-microscope-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"microscope","sort_order":1,"sense":"顯微鏡","alt_zh":"高中生在老師指導下，透過顯微鏡仔細觀察玻片上的薄葉樣本。","example":"We used a microscope to examine a thin leaf sample.","example_zh":"我們用顯微鏡觀察薄薄的葉片樣本。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/microscope-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-migration-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"migration","sort_order":1,"sense":"遷移","alt_zh":"高中生從安全海岸觀景區用望遠鏡看成群候鳥飛向遠方。","example":"The students watched the birds' migration along the coast.","example_zh":"學生觀察鳥類沿海岸遷徙。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/migration-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-militia-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"militia","sort_order":1,"sense":"民兵","alt_zh":"高中生在博物館看成年村民組成歷史民兵的模型，無武器使用、戰鬥或傷者。","example":"The history exhibit showed a militia formed by local adults.","example_zh":"歷史展覽呈現由當地成年人組成的民兵。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/militia-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-millennium-01-v1","level":"senior","word":