":"The portrait showed the monarch at a formal court ceremony.","example_zh":"肖像描繪君主參加正式宮廷典禮。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/monarch-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-monastery-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"monastery","sort_order":1,"sense":"修道院","alt_zh":"高中生從安全步道遠望樹林環繞的古老修道院，氣氛安靜。","example":"The quiet monastery stood among the trees above the valley.","example_zh":"寧靜修道院坐落在山谷上方的樹林中。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/monastery-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-monetary-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"monetary","sort_order":1,"sense":"貨幣的；金錢的","alt_zh":"成年社區代表把獎金信封交給高中社團，旁邊展示復育成功的池塘照片。","example":"The club received a monetary award for restoring the pond.","example_zh":"社團因復育池塘而獲得獎金。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/monetary-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-monopolize-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"monopolize","sort_order":1,"sense":"壟斷；獨佔","alt_zh":"一位高中生持續說話，老師溫和示意讓其他同學輪流表達。","example":"Please do not monopolize the conversation during our club meeting.","example_zh":"社團會議時，請不要獨佔發言時間。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/monopolize-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-monument-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"monument","sort_order":1,"sense":"紀念碑","alt_zh":"高中生走到城鎮廣場入口，欣賞一座無可讀銘文的古老石碑。","example":"The old stone monument marked the entrance to the town square.","example_zh":"古老石碑標示城鎮廣場的入口。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/monument-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-morality-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"morality","sort_order":1,"sense":"道德","alt_zh":"高中讀書小組討論故事，一位學生把借來的書完整交還朋友，老師在旁傾聽。","example":"The story raised questions about morality and keeping promises.","example_zh":"故事引發關於道德與守信的問題。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/morality-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-mortality-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"mortality","sort_order":1,"sense":"死亡率","alt_zh":"成年研究人員查看兩張匿名無數值統計圖，以抽象人物圖示比較比例，無遺體或傷者。","example":"The researchers compared mortality rates in the two regions.","example_zh":"研究人員比較兩個地區的死亡率。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/mortality-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-mortgage-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"mortgage","sort_order":1,"sense":"房貸","alt_zh":"成年家人與銀行人員在房屋模型、鑰匙和無字貸款文件前平靜討論。","example":"The family discussed the mortgage with the bank before buying the house.","example_zh":"這家人買房前，先和銀行討論房貸。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/mortgage-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-mosque-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"mosque","sort_order":1,"sense":"清真寺","alt_zh":"高中生與成年導覽員尊重地站在清真寺外庭院，欣賞圓頂與拱廊，無可讀文字。","example":"The visitors admired the mosque's dome from the courtyard.","example_zh":"訪客從庭院欣賞清真寺的圓頂。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/mosque-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-motivation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"motivation","sort_order":1,"sense":"動機","alt_zh":"高中女生在圖書館陪小學生閱讀，其他社團成員友善加入。","example":"Helping the younger students became her motivation for joining the club.","example_zh":"幫助年幼學生，成為她加入社團的動機。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/motivation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-multinational-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"multinational","sort_order":1,"sense":"跨國的","alt_zh":"不同背景的成年研究人員平等合作研究模型，桌旁有無字地球儀與樣本。","example":"The multinational team brought together researchers from several countries.","example_zh":"跨國研究團隊集合來自數個國家的研究人員。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/multinational-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-municipality-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"municipality","sort_order":1,"sense":"市政；地方自治政府","alt_zh":"成年市政工人在圖書館外鋪平步道，高中生從安全區等候，無機關標誌。","example":"The municipality repaired the path near the public library.","example_zh":"地方自治政府修復了公共圖書館附近的步道。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/municipality-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-mutation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"mutation","sort_order":1,"sense":"突變","alt_zh":"高中生比較兩串彩珠基因模型，其中一個位置的珠子顏色不同，無實驗或編輯基因操作。","example":"The class used colored beads to represent a mutation in a gene.","example_zh":"班上用彩珠代表基因中的一次突變。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/mutation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-narrative-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"narrative","sort_order":1,"sense":"敘事","alt_zh":"高中生沿展覽觀察同一家庭出發、乘船與抵達新家的歷史模型，單一連續展示。","example":"The museum's narrative followed one family's journey across the sea.","example_zh":"博物館的敘事追隨一個家庭跨海的旅程。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/narrative-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-nationality-01-v1","level":"senior","wo