/senior/nitrogen-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-nobility-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"nobility","sort_order":1,"sense":"貴族","alt_zh":"高中生在博物館觀看幾幅成年歷史貴族的端莊正式肖像。","example":"The portraits showed members of the nobility in formal court attire.","example_zh":"肖像呈現貴族穿著正式宮廷服裝的模樣。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/nobility-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-nominate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"nominate","sort_order":1,"sense":"提名","alt_zh":"高中社團成員舉手推薦一位樂於助人的同學，老師在旁微笑。","example":"The club voted to nominate Nora for the volunteer award.","example_zh":"社團投票提名諾拉角逐志工獎。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/nominate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-nonchalant-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"nonchalant","sort_order":1,"sense":"漫不經心的；若無其事的","alt_zh":"成年鋼琴家在舞台側邊輕鬆坐著，其他演出者認真準備，表情自然。","example":"The pianist seemed nonchalant before the difficult performance.","example_zh":"鋼琴家在困難演出前，看起來若無其事。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/nonchalant-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-nonprofit-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"nonprofit","sort_order":1,"sense":"非營利的","alt_zh":"成年志工在社區工坊免費協助孩子修車，父母與高中志工在旁幫忙，無文字。","example":"The nonprofit group repaired bicycles for children in the community.","example_zh":"非營利團體為社區孩子修理腳踏車。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/nonprofit-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-norm-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"norm","sort_order":1,"sense":"規範；常態","alt_zh":"高中生在老師旁自然地輪流使用與傳遞工具，大家都有參與機會。","example":"Sharing tools fairly became the norm in our workshop.","example_zh":"公平共用工具，成為工坊裡的常態。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/norm-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-notable-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"notable","sort_order":1,"sense":"顯著的","alt_zh":"高中生將一週前小幼苗的照片放在長高的同株盆栽旁比較，無字。","example":"The seedlings showed notable growth after a week of care.","example_zh":"細心照顧一週後，幼苗明顯長大。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/notable-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-notification-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"notification","sort_order":1,"sense":"通知","alt_zh":"高中生看手機上無文字的鈴鐺提醒圖示，後方圖書館正在準備工作坊。","example":"A notification reminded us that the library workshop would begin soon.","example_zh":"一則通知提醒我們，圖書館工作坊即將開始。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/notification-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-notorious-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"notorious","sort_order":1,"sense":"惡名昭彰的","alt_zh":"成年工人在封閉安全路段查看許多深坑洞，遠處有居民改走平整步道。","example":"The old road was notorious for its deep potholes.","example_zh":"那條老路因坑洞深而惡名昭彰。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/notorious-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-novelty-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"novelty","sort_order":1,"sense":"新奇","alt_zh":"高中生展示可愛小型機器人，市集觀眾好奇圍觀並微笑。","example":"The novelty of the tiny robot attracted a crowd at the fair.","example_zh":"小機器人的新奇感，在市集吸引了一群人。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/novelty-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-nuclear-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"nuclear","sort_order":1,"sense":"核能的","alt_zh":"成年導覽員向高中生展示抽象原子核與能源展示模型，無反應爐細節、公式或製作操作。","example":"The science museum introduced nuclear energy through a simple model.","example_zh":"科學博物館用簡單模型介紹核能。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/nuclear-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-nurture-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"nurture","sort_order":1,"sense":"培育","alt_zh":"高中生與老師在校園旁替幼樹澆水、整理支架，樹葉健康。","example":"We carefully nurture the young trees planted beside the school.","example_zh":"我們細心培育種在學校旁的幼樹。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/nurture-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-oath-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"oath","sort_order":1,"sense":"宣誓","alt_zh":"成年新任法官在正式典禮上舉手宣誓，無特定國家標誌或可讀文字。","example":"The new judge took an oath to serve fairly.","example_zh":"新任法官宣誓公正服務。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/oath-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-obedience-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"obedience","sort_order":1,"sense":"服從","alt_zh":"成年飼主溫柔示意小狗坐下，小狗安穩坐著，氣氛友善，無懲罰。","example":"The dog's obedience improved with gentle, consistent training.","example_zh":"透過溫和且一致的訓練，小狗更能聽從指令。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/obedience-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-objection-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"objection","sort_order":1,"sense":"反對","alt_zh":"高中女生在社團中禮貌舉手，邀請原本站在一旁的同學加入。","example":"Nora raised an objection to leaving one classmate out.","example_zh":"諾拉對排除一位同學提出反對。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/objection-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","styl