領的那段歲月。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/occupation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-occurrence-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"occurrence","sort_order":1,"sense":"發生","alt_zh":"成年管理員在安全室內指向天花板滴水處，高中生用水桶接住水滴。","example":"The occurrence of a small leak led us to inspect the roof.","example_zh":"一次小漏水，讓我們檢查屋頂。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/occurrence-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-offspring-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"offspring","sort_order":1,"sense":"後代","alt_zh":"成年天鵝帶著幾隻小天鵝在清澈平靜池塘上游動，畫面溫暖。","example":"The swan guided her offspring across the quiet pond.","example_zh":"天鵝帶領後代游過安靜池塘。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/offspring-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-oligarchy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"oligarchy","sort_order":1,"sense":"寡頭政治","alt_zh":"歷史老師用虛構城邦模型向高中生解說，少數成年代表圍桌掌管決策，無真實國家標誌。","example":"The lesson described an oligarchy controlled by a few powerful families.","example_zh":"課程介紹由少數強大家族控制的寡頭政體。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/oligarchy-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-omen-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"omen","sort_order":1,"sense":"預兆","alt_zh":"虛構故事中的村民抬頭看歸來燕子，春日村莊充滿希望與柔光。","example":"In the tale, the returning swallows were a good omen.","example_zh":"故事裡，燕子歸來被視為好預兆。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/omen-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-omission-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"omission","sort_order":1,"sense":"遺漏","alt_zh":"高中生與老師檢查背包物品與無字圖示清單，發現漏掉手電筒並補上。","example":"We noticed the omission of a flashlight while checking the camping list.","example_zh":"檢查露營清單時，我們發現漏列了手電筒。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/omission-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-onset-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"onset","sort_order":1,"sense":"開始","alt_zh":"高中生在老師旁替菜園幼苗罩上透明保護蓋，周圍有薄霜。","example":"The onset of winter made us cover the young plants.","example_zh":"冬天開始時，我們替幼苗蓋上保護罩。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/onset-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-opaque-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"opaque","sort_order":1,"sense":"不透明的","alt_zh":"老師與高中生比較裝彩珠的透明盒與完全不透明、關閉的紙盒，單一桌面場景。","example":"Unlike the clear container, the opaque box hid its contents.","example_zh":"不像透明容器，不透明的盒子把內容物遮住了。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/opaque-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-oppression-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"oppression","sort_order":1,"sense":"壓迫","alt_zh":"高中生在博物館觀察虛構歷史村民面對不公管控的模型，成年人物無暴力或傷害。","example":"The museum explained how villagers resisted years of oppression.","example_zh":"博物館說明村民如何反抗多年壓迫。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/oppression-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-optimism-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"optimism","sort_order":1,"sense":"樂觀","alt_zh":"高中生面對壞掉的模型仍微笑互相鼓勵，拿起工具重新合作。","example":"With optimism, the team began rebuilding the broken model.","example_zh":"小組抱持樂觀，開始重建壞掉的模型。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/optimism-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-orbit-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"orbit","sort_order":1,"sense":"軌道","alt_zh":"老師指向無字地球與月球立體模型，細線表示月球繞地球的軌道，高中生觀察。","example":"The classroom model showed the Moon's orbit around Earth.","example_zh":"教室模型展示月球繞地球的軌道。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/orbit-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-ordeal-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"ordeal","sort_order":1,"sense":"磨難","alt_zh":"成年旅人帶著濕行李終於抵達溫暖木屋，疲憊但安全，窗外仍下雨。","example":"The long journey through the storm was an ordeal for the travelers.","example_zh":"穿越暴風雨的漫長旅程，是旅人們的一場磨難。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/ordeal-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-ordinance-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"ordinance","sort_order":1,"sense":"法令","alt_zh":"成年市政人員向居民出示無可讀文字的法令文件，後方廣場老樹受到妥善保護。","example":"The town ordinance protected the old trees in the square.","example_zh":"城鎮法令保護廣場上的老樹。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/ordinance-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1}]$senior_rows$::jsonb) as r(id text,level text,word text,sort_order integer,sense text,alt_zh text,example text,example_zh text,image_url text,local_path text,style text,version integer) on conflict(id) do nothing;
